    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't want to fill it with anything. that's the thing. everything feels so meaningless now. like, why bother trying to find \"meaning\" or \"stories\" when the one thing that actually felt real and pure is just... dead? it just feels like a waste of energy to keep going through the motions when the silence is just gonna be there every single day.",
